PROJECT SchoolManagement

TARGET PHP

PROFILE COMPANY_STANDARD

DATABASE MYSQL

AUTH JWT

MODEL Student
    name STRING
    email STRING

MODEL Teacher
    name STRING
    email STRING

MODEL Course
    title STRING
    code STRING

RELATION Student HAS_MANY Course
RELATION Teacher HAS_MANY Course

VALIDATE email REQUIRED EMAIL

ROUTE GET /students
ROUTE GET /teachers
ROUTE GET /courses
